WEBVTT

00:07.080 --> 00:10.520
Have you ever heard about that

00:10.520 --> 00:13.900
the cliff of a snow mountain

00:13.920 --> 00:19.590
once fascinated numerous people?

00:20.720 --> 00:23.960
Legend has it that,

00:23.960 --> 00:27.310
there were treasures at the peak

00:27.600 --> 00:33.230
but also there was a bottomless chasm hidden over there.

00:34.280 --> 00:37.740
The smart, the fool

00:37.760 --> 00:41.110
and the kind people,

00:41.200 --> 00:47.590
all are familiar to you.

00:47.920 --> 00:51.780
On the mountainside, on the cliff,

00:51.800 --> 00:54.780
on the cloud,

00:54.800 --> 01:00.470
and in the human world,

01:11.760 --> 01:19.590
snowflakes are drifting profusely and disorderly.

01:30.800 --> 01:34.800
Joy of Life Season 1

01:34.800 --> 01:38.030
Episode 25

01:51.900 --> 01:53.280
What are you looking at?

01:53.940 --> 01:55.490
Look at that cloud!

01:56.730 --> 01:58.560
You're so relaxed and carefree today.

01:59.300 --> 02:01.490
Doesn't it look like a pile of silver?

02:02.450 --> 02:04.280
That's definitely your style.

02:04.300 --> 02:05.050
What if

02:05.050 --> 02:07.480
I took all the silver back?

02:07.500 --> 02:08.780
How happy my wife and daughter

02:08.780 --> 02:10.760
would be!

02:13.140 --> 02:15.200
Are we going back to the Fan mansion?

02:15.290 --> 02:16.760
Wang Qinian,

02:17.850 --> 02:19.140
have you ever heard of Zhuang Mohan?

02:19.140 --> 02:20.370
I have.

02:20.420 --> 02:21.630
He arrived in the capital city today.

02:21.650 --> 02:23.910
All the scholars in the capital city

02:23.930 --> 02:25.530
went to pay respects to him.

02:25.780 --> 02:27.160
He's so respected!

02:27.180 --> 02:28.910
It's known to all the scholars that

02:28.930 --> 02:31.160
Zhuang Mohan is a literary giant,

02:31.180 --> 02:32.650
a living saint

02:32.650 --> 02:33.470
in the world,

02:33.490 --> 02:35.960
and the teacher to all scholars.

02:35.980 --> 02:37.040
Don't you know that?

02:37.060 --> 02:39.250
Aren't you a scholar, too?

02:39.820 --> 02:41.090
I'm not.

02:41.140 --> 02:42.680
You're so modest.

02:42.700 --> 02:43.320
You've written poems

02:43.340 --> 02:45.040
with universal praise.

02:45.060 --> 02:47.170
You're definitely a scholar!

02:48.850 --> 02:50.090
Let's go.

02:53.930 --> 02:55.400
What's up?

02:59.060 --> 02:59.080
Master Shadow.

02:59.080 --> 02:59.900
=Shadow, Director of the Sixth Division=
Master Shadow.

02:59.900 --> 03:00.120
=Shadow, Director of the Sixth Division
of the Nanqing Investigator's Office=

03:00.140 --> 03:01.190
Does Chen Pingping have anything for me?

03:01.210 --> 03:03.120
Someone wants to kill the Head.

03:03.140 --> 03:03.700
In the world,

03:03.700 --> 03:05.160
a lot of people want to kill him.

03:05.180 --> 03:07.810
They will attack in less than an hour.

03:08.980 --> 03:10.370
Where is he?

03:11.210 --> 03:12.290
In the Investigator's Office.

03:12.290 --> 03:13.400
Then he'll be fine.

03:13.420 --> 03:14.270
Without massive forces,

03:14.290 --> 03:15.800
no one can break into
the Investigator's Office to kill him.

03:15.820 --> 03:16.850
Now no one

03:16.850 --> 03:18.170
is protecting the Head.

03:18.340 --> 03:19.760
What do you mean?

03:19.780 --> 03:21.190
Zhuang Mohan has arrived in the capital city.

03:21.210 --> 03:21.930
How is Zhuang Mohan

03:21.930 --> 03:23.450
relevant to this?

03:23.650 --> 03:25.160
Zhuang Mohan's arrival

03:25.180 --> 03:27.120
leads to the change.

03:27.290 --> 03:28.540
Everyone in the Investigator's Office knows that

03:28.540 --> 03:30.040
the only way to restart the war

03:30.060 --> 03:32.250
is to assassinate Zhuang Mohan.

03:33.450 --> 03:36.320
But the Head has sent the First Division

03:36.340 --> 03:38.170
to protect Zhuang Mohan.

03:38.780 --> 03:39.920
Right.

03:40.210 --> 03:41.260
Zhu Ge from the First Division

03:41.260 --> 03:42.880
has led all his men out.

03:42.900 --> 03:45.370
Fei Jie from the Third Division is not in the capital city.

03:45.540 --> 03:47.320
Martial arts masters from other divisions

03:47.340 --> 03:49.250
have been sent out by me respectively.

03:49.780 --> 03:51.800
Today, all the officials inside

03:51.820 --> 03:53.350
the Investigator's Office are on our side.

03:53.370 --> 03:54.260
Even so, we don't have enough men

03:54.260 --> 03:56.560
to kill Zhuang Mohan.

04:01.820 --> 04:03.530
Zhuang Mohan is just a cover.

04:03.570 --> 04:05.550
The person we're really going to kill

04:05.570 --> 04:07.530
is Chen Pingping.

04:26.650 --> 04:28.010
You're here.

04:35.020 --> 04:35.980
We have no way out.

04:35.980 --> 04:37.320
Let's go to the dungeon.

04:40.050 --> 04:41.350
You all know that

04:41.370 --> 04:42.610
Chen Pingping is the person

04:42.610 --> 04:44.010
preventing us from restarting the war

04:44.210 --> 04:45.840
in the Investigator's Office.

04:45.860 --> 04:46.840
If he dies,

04:46.860 --> 04:48.070
the Investigator's Office will be controlled

04:48.090 --> 04:50.250
by loyal people like us.

04:50.580 --> 04:52.630
By then, it will be very easy

04:52.650 --> 04:53.750
to motivate His Majesty

04:53.770 --> 04:55.600
to destroy Beiqi.

04:56.370 --> 04:57.760
He's also a man.

04:57.890 --> 04:59.350
I've exhausted my abilities

04:59.370 --> 05:00.910
to create a favorable situation for us.

05:00.930 --> 05:02.740
If we don't kill him today, we won't have a second chance.

05:02.740 --> 05:05.170
Kill Chen Pingping! Kill Chen Pingping!

05:05.170 --> 05:07.960
Kill Chen Pingping!

05:07.980 --> 05:09.600
Once Chen Pingping is killed,

05:09.740 --> 05:11.150
the Investigator's Office

05:11.170 --> 05:13.290
will be controlled by us.

05:14.860 --> 05:16.160
What's done is done.

05:16.370 --> 05:18.010
There's no way back.

05:18.370 --> 05:19.640
Let's do it!

05:20.020 --> 05:25.280
Kill Chen Pingping! Kill Chen Pingping!

05:25.300 --> 05:27.970
Kill Chen Pingping!

05:34.370 --> 05:35.970
Mr. Fan?

05:36.890 --> 05:38.330
Miss Lili, let's talk later.

05:38.330 --> 05:39.690
We're being hunted.

05:39.770 --> 05:41.370
Hunted?

05:50.300 --> 05:52.320
Press that.

06:00.580 --> 06:01.680
It leads to

06:01.700 --> 06:03.480
the deepest part of the dungeon,

06:03.650 --> 06:05.020
where the most vicious villains

06:05.020 --> 06:07.520
are locked up inside.

06:07.540 --> 06:09.200
Let's get inside first.

06:19.490 --> 06:20.980
Are we safe here?

06:20.980 --> 06:22.170
Not really.

06:22.170 --> 06:23.930
Many people know this path.

06:23.930 --> 06:25.020
They usually deliver water

06:25.020 --> 06:26.330
and food to the prisoners.

06:26.330 --> 06:26.930
Sometimes,

06:26.930 --> 06:28.440
they have to pull out the bodies.

06:28.460 --> 06:30.070
Then what's the point of hiding here?

06:30.090 --> 06:32.310
It's narrow inside. Maybe we can resist them for a while.

06:32.330 --> 06:34.760
Then we'll have to die sooner or later.

06:35.610 --> 06:37.130
It's a dead end.

06:40.090 --> 06:41.720
This is terrible!

06:41.740 --> 06:44.600
I can't die.

06:46.460 --> 06:48.070
I haven't told my wife yet.

06:48.090 --> 06:49.260
If I die without her permission,

06:49.260 --> 06:52.090
she will definitely be angry.

06:52.540 --> 06:53.370
We're in great danger,

06:53.370 --> 06:55.190
yet you're afraid your wife might be angry.

06:55.210 --> 06:57.020
Life or death, it doesn't matter.

06:57.020 --> 06:59.400
What really matters is
whether I've gained permission from my wife or not.

06:59.420 --> 07:01.370
You don't understand.

07:03.020 --> 07:05.130
What will happen to Si Lili outside?

07:08.580 --> 07:09.870
They want to kill me.

07:09.890 --> 07:12.130
They won't leave anyone alive.

07:13.770 --> 07:15.160
Give me the key to her cell.

07:15.300 --> 07:17.120
You can't even protect yourself. Why care about others?

07:17.140 --> 07:18.480
The key!

07:22.090 --> 07:23.570
Wait a minute.

07:31.540 --> 07:33.570
He's a good lad.

07:39.050 --> 07:40.440
What's the sound?

07:41.650 --> 07:42.880
What's the sound?

07:53.540 --> 07:55.320
Is there an internal strife in the Investigator's Office?

07:59.050 --> 08:00.640
Why do you save me?

08:01.460 --> 08:02.090
Hurry up!

08:02.090 --> 08:03.720
They could rush in any minute.

08:05.020 --> 08:09.070
Kill Chen Pingping! Kill Chen Pingping!

08:09.090 --> 08:11.760
Kill Chen Pingping!

08:12.370 --> 08:16.040
Kill him!

08:28.490 --> 08:29.140
What's the point of

08:29.140 --> 08:29.960
bringing me here?

08:29.980 --> 08:31.140
I still have to die.

08:31.140 --> 08:32.880
I've promised you to protect you.

08:32.900 --> 08:33.880
Even if you have to die,

08:33.900 --> 08:35.350
you must die after me.

08:35.370 --> 08:36.720
Go inside.

08:43.260 --> 08:44.400
Your Excellency.

08:46.220 --> 08:47.440
What's this?

08:47.460 --> 08:48.560
I've told you about

08:48.580 --> 08:50.010
the prisoners locked up here.

08:50.100 --> 08:51.760
The most vicious villains?

08:51.780 --> 08:53.010
Right.

08:53.340 --> 08:55.010
One of them is still alive.

08:58.780 --> 09:00.770
So many chains are used to lock up only one person?

09:01.820 --> 09:03.450
Yes, only one.

09:09.850 --> 09:11.840
Will your life be saved after looking at him?

09:12.780 --> 09:13.960
This way.

09:14.260 --> 09:16.890
He's not here.

09:16.930 --> 09:18.810
Hurry up and find Chen Pingping!

09:24.610 --> 09:25.660
He's not here.

09:25.660 --> 09:27.020
No, He's not here. He's not here.

09:27.020 --> 09:28.460
He's not here.

09:28.460 --> 09:29.340
Where is he?

09:29.340 --> 09:30.270
Go inside and find him!

09:30.290 --> 09:34.340
He's not here.

09:34.340 --> 09:35.810
Wait a moment!

09:57.850 --> 09:58.820
I'm going to die.

09:58.820 --> 09:59.780
Can I at least satisfy

09:59.780 --> 10:00.960
my curiosity?

10:06.220 --> 10:07.200
Is he really dangerous?

10:07.220 --> 10:08.690
Indeed!

10:09.850 --> 10:11.280
His name is Xiao En.

10:12.970 --> 10:16.210
I was paralyzed because of him.

10:17.900 --> 10:19.470
Chen Pingping is inside.

10:19.490 --> 10:20.950
He has no way to go.

10:20.970 --> 10:23.510
-Kill him! -Come on!

10:23.530 --> 10:25.760
Kill him!

10:25.780 --> 10:28.560
-Kill him! -Kill Chen Pingping!

10:28.580 --> 10:29.340
They've opened the door

10:29.340 --> 10:31.250
to the secret path.

10:31.660 --> 10:35.570
-Kill Chen Pingping! -Kill Chen Pingping!

10:40.370 --> 10:41.920
Catch him!

10:43.410 --> 10:44.690
Si Lili.

10:45.900 --> 10:47.130
What?

10:47.530 --> 10:48.890
Beiqi is defeated.

10:49.610 --> 10:51.150
Why do you tell me that?

10:51.170 --> 10:54.040
I'm nervous. I have to say something.

11:03.100 --> 11:04.020
Actually there's another way

11:04.020 --> 11:04.950
to save our lives.

11:04.970 --> 11:07.370
They only want to kill Chen Pingping.

11:10.490 --> 11:11.730
Do you believe they will

11:11.730 --> 11:13.030
let us go?

11:13.050 --> 11:14.760
We can kill him first.

11:14.780 --> 11:17.480
Then we can trade his head for our lives.

11:19.780 --> 11:21.810
This is the only way to save our lives.

11:30.580 --> 11:31.640
Wang Qinian.

11:31.660 --> 11:32.840
Your Excellency.

11:33.170 --> 11:34.450
Let's take the risk.

11:34.930 --> 11:36.280
OK.

11:37.580 --> 11:38.350
What are you doing?

11:38.370 --> 11:39.690
Just wait.

11:43.460 --> 11:45.200
It's Shadow! He's alone!

11:45.220 --> 11:46.150
Kill him!

11:46.170 --> 11:47.760
-He's alone! -Kill him!

11:47.780 --> 11:48.700
Kill him!

11:48.700 --> 11:50.390
All the men outside are martial arts masters.

11:50.410 --> 11:52.650
How long can he hold by himself?

12:10.700 --> 12:13.080
The noise of fighting is further and further away from us.

12:19.410 --> 12:20.840
He has killed a way out?

12:21.410 --> 12:22.580
Are those opponents

12:22.580 --> 12:23.920
too weak?

12:24.460 --> 12:27.210
They are all martial arts masters above the Seventh Dan.

12:28.220 --> 12:30.480
It's really not my idea.

12:35.370 --> 12:36.570
What did you just say?

12:39.700 --> 12:41.450
Shadow wants to test you.

12:41.700 --> 12:42.830
It's not my idea.

12:42.850 --> 12:44.250
What?

12:44.660 --> 12:46.210
Test me?

12:46.260 --> 12:48.470
Are those men outside acting?

12:48.490 --> 12:50.440
They do want to kill me.

12:50.460 --> 12:51.610
Are there other martial arts masters

12:51.610 --> 12:52.410
ambushing in the dark?

12:52.410 --> 12:53.830
There aren't any reinforcements.

12:53.850 --> 12:55.200
Then why do you say it's a test?

12:55.220 --> 12:58.570
Shadow alone can resist one thousand cavalrymen.

12:59.900 --> 13:01.150
I don't know.

13:01.170 --> 13:02.140
I've never seen Master Shadow

13:02.140 --> 13:03.690
in a fight.

13:06.700 --> 13:08.040
Si Lili,

13:08.460 --> 13:09.970
just now when Shadow left

13:09.970 --> 13:10.530
and the other two

13:10.530 --> 13:11.950
were not by my side,

13:11.970 --> 13:14.440
I thought you would hold me hostage.

13:14.460 --> 13:17.000
That might be your last chance

13:17.020 --> 13:18.890
to escape.

13:21.970 --> 13:23.330
I know.

13:24.900 --> 13:26.450
Why did you hesitate?

13:27.900 --> 13:29.280
I dared not.

13:31.100 --> 13:32.450
In Beiqi,

13:32.900 --> 13:34.840
Chen Pingping

13:35.050 --> 13:37.040
is as scary as demons.

13:42.170 --> 13:43.840
Push me out.

13:51.290 --> 13:53.010
Chen Pingping,

13:54.140 --> 13:58.280
don't die. Wait for me to get out.

14:05.900 --> 14:08.400
He's afraid I might be killed by others.

14:09.410 --> 14:10.880
He won't get out.

14:10.900 --> 14:12.280
Let's go.

14:31.100 --> 14:31.900
So you knew

14:31.900 --> 14:32.900
they wanted to kill you?

14:32.900 --> 14:34.160
Yes.

14:34.460 --> 14:35.890
Yet you just let them.

14:35.970 --> 14:38.350
Independent from the Six
Ministries, the Investigator's Office

14:38.370 --> 14:39.590
is an important organization with great power.

14:39.610 --> 14:40.680
Though I'm the Head,

14:40.700 --> 14:42.880
I can't guard against the world.

14:42.900 --> 14:43.970
There will always be organizations

14:43.970 --> 14:46.000
finding ways to plant agents

14:46.020 --> 14:48.270
who are good at hiding themselves.

14:48.290 --> 14:49.370
By giving them the chance to kill me,

14:49.370 --> 14:50.700
they would jump out

14:50.700 --> 14:52.890
and be exposed once and for all.

15:00.370 --> 15:01.770
Wang Qinian.

15:16.530 --> 15:18.520
Use yourself as bait.

15:19.700 --> 15:21.390
Smart as they are,

15:21.410 --> 15:22.510
they wouldn't be tricked

15:22.530 --> 15:24.080
without seeing me.

15:24.340 --> 15:25.270
We've walked a long way,

15:25.290 --> 15:27.080
but we've seen no one alive.

15:28.220 --> 15:30.960
This is the consequence of walking into a trap.

15:31.050 --> 15:33.480
I find it safer inside.

15:52.460 --> 15:54.080
There's no sound outside.

15:54.290 --> 15:56.010
It should be safe.

15:57.730 --> 16:00.130
Would you find me ruthless?

16:00.730 --> 16:01.950
They want to kill others.

16:01.970 --> 16:03.650
It's natural for them to be killed.

16:04.490 --> 16:06.280
Moving forward with a heavy burden,

16:06.580 --> 16:08.920
they just can't help it.

16:09.930 --> 16:12.160
Wang Qinian, open the door.

16:12.410 --> 16:15.130
The jade is good.

16:58.580 --> 16:59.680
Head.

16:59.700 --> 17:01.030
I saw Shadow killing our colleagues

17:01.050 --> 17:03.890
when I came back to the Investigator's Office.

17:03.980 --> 17:05.480
I asked him to.

17:10.290 --> 17:11.650
You should be monitoring

17:11.650 --> 17:13.440
Zhuang Mohan from Beiqi.

17:13.460 --> 17:15.320
Why are you back?

17:17.740 --> 17:19.170
Something is wrong.

17:19.700 --> 17:22.370
Zhuang Mohan is missing.

17:25.620 --> 17:27.560
Upon arrival in the capital city,

17:27.580 --> 17:29.080
Zhuang Mohan stayed

17:29.100 --> 17:30.440
in the residence arranged by
the Court of State Ceremonials,

17:30.460 --> 17:31.990
and never came out.

17:32.010 --> 17:33.360
I found it strange,

17:33.380 --> 17:34.740
so I asked my man to dress up as

17:34.740 --> 17:36.080
a servant to clean the room.

17:40.050 --> 17:41.270
Master Zhuang.

17:41.290 --> 17:44.170
May I clean your room?

17:46.700 --> 17:48.010
Master Zhuang.

18:06.650 --> 18:07.720
It turned out that

18:07.740 --> 18:09.530
Zhuang Mohan was not there.

18:10.650 --> 18:12.440
Who visited him before?

18:12.460 --> 18:14.720
Officials from Imperial College, Ministry of Personnel,

18:14.740 --> 18:15.960
Ministry of Rites, and Censorate

18:15.980 --> 18:17.930
all visited him.

18:19.980 --> 18:22.530
It seems that they really admire Zhuang Mohan,

18:22.770 --> 18:24.720
so they consulted him in person.

18:24.820 --> 18:25.620
Then why did they

18:25.620 --> 18:27.680
sneak him out?

18:27.700 --> 18:28.910
Head,

18:28.930 --> 18:32.080
Zhuang Mohan is a literary giant.

18:32.170 --> 18:33.320
His words and behaviors can influence

18:33.340 --> 18:35.530
the scholars all over the world.

18:36.290 --> 18:38.080
Now he's missing.

18:38.100 --> 18:39.870
I'm afraid it's a big deal.

18:39.890 --> 18:41.510
List the visitors

18:41.530 --> 18:42.840
for me.

18:42.860 --> 18:44.080
Yes.

18:44.580 --> 18:46.390
I come back to ask for your order

18:46.410 --> 18:48.030
to investigate the capital city

18:48.050 --> 18:49.110
thoroughly.

18:49.130 --> 18:50.930
Just forget it.

18:53.500 --> 18:54.990
Now you're back.

18:55.010 --> 18:56.320
Call back all the Directors

18:56.340 --> 18:57.770
in the capital city.

18:59.700 --> 19:01.370
I have something to say.

19:02.410 --> 19:03.720
Yes.

19:08.380 --> 19:09.980
Head. Your Excellency.

19:09.980 --> 19:11.110
I should go back home

19:11.130 --> 19:13.010
to see my wife.

19:20.530 --> 19:22.390
I'm also leaving if everything is fine.

19:22.410 --> 19:23.930
Wait.

19:25.050 --> 19:26.480
You should meet them.

19:55.770 --> 19:57.170
Everyone is here.

19:57.740 --> 19:59.290
Let me introduce them to you.

19:59.700 --> 20:02.150
Zhu Ge, Director of the First Division.

20:02.170 --> 20:04.440
Yan Ruohai, Director of the Fourth Division.

20:04.460 --> 20:06.230
You've met them before.

20:06.250 --> 20:07.630
The Director of the Second Division

20:07.650 --> 20:09.320
is working in the frontier.

20:09.340 --> 20:12.600
Black knights, Director of the Fifth Division,

20:12.740 --> 20:13.960
is not in the capital city.

20:13.980 --> 20:15.560
Shadow, Director of the Sixth Division.

20:15.580 --> 20:17.460
Director of the Seventh Division

20:17.460 --> 20:18.840
is still working in the Jiangnan area.

20:18.860 --> 20:21.050
Xuan Jiu, Director of the Eighth Division.

20:21.560 --> 20:21.700
=Xuan Jiu, Director of the Eighth Division
of the Investigator's Office of Nanqing=

20:21.700 --> 20:23.620
=Xuan Jiu, Director of the Eighth Division=
He's in charge of book publishing.

20:23.620 --> 20:24.320
=Xuan Jiu, Director of the Eighth Division
of the Investigator's Office of Nanqing=

20:24.340 --> 20:26.750
You just opened a bookstore, right?

20:26.770 --> 20:28.290
He's in charge of that.

20:29.130 --> 20:30.480
Your Excellency Xuan, good day.

20:30.500 --> 20:31.840
The last one is Fei Jie,

20:31.860 --> 20:33.230
Director of the Third Division.

20:33.250 --> 20:34.600
Fei Jie is not here.

20:35.050 --> 20:37.370
The man taking over the Third Division

20:37.460 --> 20:39.720
for the moment is lying over there.

20:40.700 --> 20:42.320
Is he dead?

20:44.080 --> 20:46.790
=Senior Fellow Apprentice Leng, Acting Director of
the Third Division of the Investigator's Office of Nanqing=

20:47.650 --> 20:50.440
This is Fan Xian, Director-General of our Office.

20:51.340 --> 20:52.800
Your Excellencies, good day.

20:53.740 --> 20:55.360
Here comes my junior fellow apprentice.

20:55.380 --> 20:58.320
I'm surnamed Leng. I'm also a student of Master Fei.

20:58.340 --> 21:00.600
So we have the same teacher.

21:00.770 --> 21:02.230
Senior Fellow Apprentice Leng, what's wrong with you?

21:02.250 --> 21:04.650
I developed a new poison.

21:05.010 --> 21:07.010
I took some.

21:08.500 --> 21:09.560
It's good.

21:09.580 --> 21:10.800
Didn't you make the antidote?

21:10.820 --> 21:12.410
I failed.

21:12.740 --> 21:14.480
It's getting worse.

21:14.500 --> 21:16.170
You work so hard.

21:16.820 --> 21:19.910
When I get better, I'll invite you to dinner.

21:19.930 --> 21:21.230
I'll cook myself.

21:21.250 --> 21:23.250
Please don't. No need to bother you.

21:24.010 --> 21:25.320
Fine.

21:25.580 --> 21:28.320
I need some rest now.

21:31.380 --> 21:32.440
Now we've all met.

21:32.460 --> 21:34.480
I'll come straight to the point.

21:34.500 --> 21:37.380
Today, someone set a trap here

21:37.380 --> 21:38.930
to kill me.

21:45.890 --> 21:47.560
Fan Xian saved me.

21:49.250 --> 21:51.030
It was Shadow, right?

21:51.050 --> 21:52.130
I saw him.

21:52.130 --> 21:53.600
You're mistaken.

21:54.010 --> 21:55.930
I'm old.

21:56.010 --> 21:58.600
In future, Fan Xian can take my place.

21:58.820 --> 22:00.440
You should look after him.

22:05.930 --> 22:07.820
Fan Xian is new to the capital city.

22:07.820 --> 22:09.230
He doesn't know us all.

22:09.250 --> 22:10.800
It's no hurry.

22:10.820 --> 22:12.530
I'm not retiring now.

22:16.130 --> 22:17.440
Head,

22:17.740 --> 22:19.010
the Investigator's Office

22:19.010 --> 22:20.480
is the most important organization in Nanqing.

22:20.500 --> 22:22.720
Not anyone can be the Head.

22:22.740 --> 22:23.720
To me,

22:23.740 --> 22:25.380
Fan Xian is not qualified.

22:25.380 --> 22:27.320
Are you mistaken?

22:28.290 --> 22:30.680
I'm not here to asking for your approval.

22:30.930 --> 22:32.650
I'm just telling you.

22:34.620 --> 22:36.320
I think it's good.

22:36.740 --> 22:38.290
I don't know about others,

22:38.460 --> 22:39.650
but our Third Division will definitely

22:39.650 --> 22:41.320
support our junior fellow apprentice.

22:45.410 --> 22:47.320
I'll say it for the last time.

22:48.100 --> 22:50.800
It's settled. It won't be changed.

22:51.580 --> 22:53.250
Whoever feels dissatisfied

22:53.820 --> 22:55.930
should find the chance to kill me.

22:58.220 --> 22:59.560
Go.

23:14.220 --> 23:16.600
We've been through a lot these years.

23:17.010 --> 23:17.750
I originally thought you would be the one

23:17.770 --> 23:19.680
to take over the Investigator's Office.

23:23.620 --> 23:25.320
But his decision today

23:25.340 --> 23:27.270
is really disappointing.

23:27.290 --> 23:28.630
Yan Ruohai,

23:28.650 --> 23:30.150
let me be clear on one point.

23:30.170 --> 23:31.440
I don't want to fight for power.

23:31.460 --> 23:32.460
I'm not competent enough

23:32.460 --> 23:34.010
to take that position.

23:34.220 --> 23:34.770
I understand.

23:34.770 --> 23:36.080
You don't.

23:36.100 --> 23:37.010
Everything I've done

23:37.010 --> 23:38.770
is for Nanqing.

23:39.220 --> 23:40.200
I know.

23:40.220 --> 23:41.740
I've checked the bodies of

23:41.740 --> 23:43.030
those assassinations.

23:43.050 --> 23:44.720
They were bodacious.

23:44.740 --> 23:45.630
Right.

23:45.650 --> 23:47.230
Quite a few of them

23:47.250 --> 23:49.800
had visited you frequently these days.

23:50.820 --> 23:52.800
Why didn't you tell the Head just now?

23:54.290 --> 23:57.080
Yan Ruohai, what on earth are you up to?

23:57.100 --> 23:58.480
Just like you, all my decisions are made

23:58.930 --> 24:01.840
for the benefits of Nanqing.

24:11.220 --> 24:12.480
Why?

24:13.740 --> 24:15.480
What are you asking about?

24:15.500 --> 24:17.250
Handing the Investigator's Office over to me.

24:22.410 --> 24:24.480
Shadow took the liberty

24:24.500 --> 24:26.030
to test you. That's fine.

24:26.050 --> 24:27.560
We can make things clear.

24:27.580 --> 24:29.030
Zhu Ge is right.

24:29.050 --> 24:30.200
I'm not qualified yet.

24:30.220 --> 24:31.890
The Investigator's Office

24:32.130 --> 24:33.980
was founded by your mother.

24:33.980 --> 24:35.200
For all these years,

24:35.220 --> 24:37.410
I've been guarding this place for her.

24:39.460 --> 24:40.990
But I'll have to

24:41.010 --> 24:42.960
return it to you after all.

24:43.860 --> 24:45.650
Circumstances change with the passage of time.

24:47.980 --> 24:50.010
The time may have passed,

24:52.220 --> 24:54.600
but my original intension remains the same.

25:01.770 --> 25:03.800
You've been to the Court of State Ceremonials, right?

25:05.530 --> 25:07.150
It's a good thing.

25:07.170 --> 25:10.290
Peace negotiation after war

25:10.530 --> 25:13.170
is important to the whole county. Take it seriously.

25:13.740 --> 25:14.480
I see.

25:14.500 --> 25:16.130
Just do your work.

25:17.130 --> 25:18.380
Tell me

25:18.380 --> 25:19.840
if anything bothers you.

25:20.050 --> 25:22.130
Tell me also

25:22.220 --> 25:23.720
if anyone makes it hard for you.

25:23.740 --> 25:25.410
I'll help you out.

25:26.170 --> 25:27.890
Anything?

25:29.820 --> 25:31.720
Anything!

25:31.770 --> 25:33.360
However difficult it might be,

25:33.380 --> 25:34.720
I'll handle it for you.

25:43.580 --> 25:44.960
Go back.

25:45.050 --> 25:46.390
You must be tired today.

25:46.410 --> 25:48.530
It's getting colder at night.

25:50.220 --> 25:52.560
Add more quilts to keep warm.

25:57.620 --> 25:59.250
You're still coughing.

26:01.380 --> 26:02.930
I'm old.

26:03.500 --> 26:04.800
It takes time to get better.

26:04.820 --> 26:07.130
I'll grab you some medicine later.

26:14.130 --> 26:15.530
Good.

26:21.050 --> 26:24.170
The heaven, earth and man exist in harmony.

26:24.290 --> 26:27.440
Gentlemen shall not stay up for work.

26:27.650 --> 26:31.840
It's midnight already.

26:56.580 --> 26:58.530
You're upset.

26:59.500 --> 27:01.080
I've been to the imperial palace.

27:01.980 --> 27:02.620
Ruoruo has drawn down the map

27:02.620 --> 27:04.890
to the Empress Dowager's palace,

27:06.010 --> 27:07.320
and I've remembered it.

27:07.340 --> 27:09.200
Then why are you upset?

27:09.740 --> 27:11.890
The Niulan Street assassination

27:14.170 --> 27:16.890
was planned by the Princess Royal.

27:17.100 --> 27:19.150
The person planned the assassination

27:19.170 --> 27:21.270
was actually comforting the target.

27:21.290 --> 27:23.130
Isn't that funny?

27:23.580 --> 27:25.250
Chen Pingping said

27:26.740 --> 27:29.200
he would hand the Investigator's Office over to me.

27:30.460 --> 27:32.250
He asked me to tell him

27:33.290 --> 27:35.010
if anything bothers me.

27:39.580 --> 27:41.360
Tell me also

27:41.380 --> 27:42.930
if anyone makes it hard for you.

27:43.860 --> 27:46.010
I almost told him about

27:46.010 --> 27:47.480
the Princess Royal.

27:48.100 --> 27:51.250
If you want to kill someone, I'm a better choice.

27:52.650 --> 27:54.600
Do you want to kill the Princess Royal?

27:58.250 --> 28:00.440
She's the mother of Wan'er after all.

28:00.650 --> 28:02.290
Do you want to kill her?

28:04.700 --> 28:08.930
The Princess Royal values power over life.

28:09.890 --> 28:13.130
We should take her down
and kick her out of the capital city.

28:13.170 --> 28:15.270
To her, that's even worse than death.

28:15.290 --> 28:16.770
That is beyond my ability.

28:16.820 --> 28:18.320
I'll do it myself.

28:18.340 --> 28:19.720
As you wish.

28:20.170 --> 28:21.440
Uncle.

28:21.930 --> 28:24.440
We should postpone our plan of

28:24.460 --> 28:26.010
breaking into the imperial harem to steal the key.

28:26.290 --> 28:28.200
We should wait for a better chance.

28:28.220 --> 28:29.530
It's up to you.

28:30.530 --> 28:31.930
Uncle.

28:32.700 --> 28:34.010
Do you know?

28:34.530 --> 28:36.530
Shadow from the Investigator's Office

28:37.820 --> 28:39.440
is really good at martial arts.

28:40.700 --> 28:41.680
I know.

28:41.700 --> 28:43.440
Is he a Great Master?

28:43.460 --> 28:44.960
He's above the Ninth Dan.

28:50.980 --> 28:52.460
Aren't there only a few

28:52.460 --> 28:53.870
martial arts masters above the Ninth Dan in Nanqing?

28:53.890 --> 28:55.110
Uncle.

28:55.130 --> 28:56.390
Have you ever seen

28:56.410 --> 28:57.600
Shadow's face?

28:57.620 --> 28:58.840
No.

29:00.770 --> 29:01.990
Uncle, do you know?

29:02.010 --> 29:03.170
I've been to the deepest part of

29:03.170 --> 29:05.370
the dungeon in the Investigator's Office.

29:05.650 --> 29:07.600
A man was locked up there.

29:08.340 --> 29:10.010
It's so scary.

29:11.700 --> 29:15.770
He was locked up by chains all over.

29:56.460 --> 29:57.930
Please.

30:00.650 --> 30:02.080
Your Excellency, you're the Deputy Receptionist.

30:02.100 --> 30:03.150
Please sit here.

30:03.170 --> 30:04.600
OK.

30:15.380 --> 30:16.770
Your Excellency,

30:17.050 --> 30:19.460
I've never negotiated with an enemy country.

30:19.460 --> 30:20.510
I feel a bit nervous.

30:20.530 --> 30:21.800
I don't know what to say later.

30:21.820 --> 30:23.080
Take it easy.

30:24.050 --> 30:27.270
Negotiation is a verbal battle between two countries.

30:27.290 --> 30:30.600
The most important thing is to

30:30.620 --> 30:33.560
mind our choice of words.

30:33.620 --> 30:34.960
We should be kind and generous when talking.

30:34.980 --> 30:37.960
In other words, we should be polite and courteous.

30:38.500 --> 30:40.320
Only then can we demonstrate

30:40.340 --> 30:42.630
the dignity and magnanimity of a powerful country.

30:42.650 --> 30:43.510
Anyway, later

30:43.530 --> 30:44.510
just leave it all

30:44.530 --> 30:45.380
to me.

30:45.380 --> 30:46.930
OK!

30:53.250 --> 30:55.320
We definitely won't return you

30:55.340 --> 30:57.290
the prefecture taken by our powerful army.

30:57.290 --> 30:58.750
That is our territory.

30:58.770 --> 31:00.030
Your territory?

31:00.050 --> 31:01.960
Really? If you want it back,

31:01.980 --> 31:03.960
just send your troops.

31:03.980 --> 31:04.910
How about this?

31:04.930 --> 31:05.960
I'll announce that

31:05.980 --> 31:06.870
the talk is suspended.

31:06.890 --> 31:08.250
We can resume our talk

31:08.250 --> 31:09.440
after the battle.

31:09.460 --> 31:10.630
Will that work for you?

31:10.650 --> 31:13.410
You! You are despicable!

31:13.410 --> 31:14.480
I know how shameless you are

31:14.500 --> 31:16.560
long before!

31:19.530 --> 31:20.740
Is that real?

31:20.740 --> 31:21.740
Of course.

31:21.740 --> 31:22.800
Let me tell you in detail.

31:22.820 --> 31:23.910
Mr. Zhang,

31:23.930 --> 31:24.620
this way, please.

31:24.620 --> 31:25.750
Let's discuss the details in my mansion.

31:25.770 --> 31:26.980
The specialty wine of this house

31:26.980 --> 31:28.030
is really good.

31:28.050 --> 31:28.990
Waiter!

31:29.010 --> 31:30.480
Coming!

31:30.500 --> 31:33.080
Waiter, come here!

31:33.170 --> 31:34.600
Change the music for me.

31:34.620 --> 31:35.930
OK.

31:38.770 --> 31:40.080
Your Excellency,

31:40.290 --> 31:42.080
we should resume the talk

31:42.100 --> 31:44.050
in the afternoon.

31:44.770 --> 31:47.200
So we'd better drink no wine.

31:48.770 --> 31:50.200
That's the right music.

31:50.220 --> 31:52.870
It suits us scholars the best.

31:52.890 --> 31:54.200
Your Excellency,

31:54.290 --> 31:55.460
are we going a bit far

31:55.460 --> 31:57.320
in the talk just now?

31:58.580 --> 32:00.370
We should be aggressive.

32:01.930 --> 32:03.890
Don't we have to demonstrate dignity
and magnanimity of our country?

32:05.620 --> 32:08.050
Our soldiers risked their lives

32:08.050 --> 32:09.230
to win the battle.

32:09.250 --> 32:10.740
If we're not aggressive,

32:10.740 --> 32:12.960
we fail those soldiers.

32:17.250 --> 32:18.770
Nice tea.

32:19.740 --> 32:24.680
Its fragrance is lingering,

32:24.700 --> 32:29.720
and its taste is profound.

32:35.380 --> 32:37.960
The prefecture occupied by our army

32:37.980 --> 32:40.030
will not be returned. Moreover,

32:40.050 --> 32:42.230
you'll have to pay for

32:42.250 --> 32:43.720
the marching expenditure of our army.

32:43.740 --> 32:45.480
How can we continue our talk if you keep acting like that?

32:46.460 --> 32:48.960
There's nothing to talk about in the first place.

33:13.220 --> 33:15.720
Your Excellency Xin, we won't

33:15.740 --> 33:19.250
concede in this talk.

33:19.890 --> 33:21.510
Are you suddenly out of your mind?

33:21.530 --> 33:24.560
There's a piece of new information on the paper.

33:24.650 --> 33:27.910
All our conditions are on it.

33:27.930 --> 33:30.390
You can have a look.

33:30.410 --> 33:32.360
We'll talk tomorrow.

33:32.380 --> 33:35.890
You can check the authenticity of the information.

33:57.340 --> 33:58.840
Gosh! It's bad news!

34:06.220 --> 34:08.840
This is a secret report sent from Beiqi just now.

34:45.770 --> 34:48.560
Head, you want to see me.

34:50.580 --> 34:53.040
There's something you should know.

34:53.250 --> 34:55.000
Bingyun was held hostage.

34:58.860 --> 35:00.600
The Imperial Guards of Beiqi did it.

35:00.620 --> 35:02.490
Shen Zhong caught Bingyun in person.

35:03.770 --> 35:05.320
Is he still alive?

35:05.340 --> 35:06.510
Yes.

35:06.530 --> 35:07.620
Beiqi wants to use him

35:07.620 --> 35:09.320
as a bargaining chip.

35:10.180 --> 35:11.520
What do they want?

35:11.580 --> 35:12.900
Firstly,

35:12.900 --> 35:15.520
they want to take back the prefecture.

35:15.860 --> 35:18.670
Secondly, they ask us

35:18.690 --> 35:19.900
to release the prisoners of war

35:19.900 --> 35:22.290
and compensate for the dead soldiers.

35:22.290 --> 35:23.450
The last

35:23.450 --> 35:24.920
is the most hateful.

35:24.940 --> 35:27.820
They want to exchange Mr. Yan

35:27.820 --> 35:28.860
for Xiao En and Si Lili.

35:28.860 --> 35:30.120
Xiao En?

35:30.140 --> 35:31.600
The one locked up in the dungeon
of the Investigator's Office?

35:31.620 --> 35:32.670
Right.

35:32.690 --> 35:33.900
He is a vicious villain

35:33.900 --> 35:35.510
from Beiqi.

35:35.530 --> 35:37.210
He was equally famous as Chen Pingping.

35:37.210 --> 35:39.210
Back then, Chen Pingping led

35:39.210 --> 35:40.420
the black knights on a long-range raid

35:40.420 --> 35:41.450
and caught him back

35:41.450 --> 35:43.030
at the cost of his legs.

35:43.050 --> 35:45.410
How can we send him back?

35:45.860 --> 35:47.600
That's right.

35:48.660 --> 35:50.800
But we won this battle

35:50.820 --> 35:53.510
so easily because Yan Bingyun

35:53.530 --> 35:54.880
inquired about military information

35:54.900 --> 35:57.270
and sent us secret reports.

35:57.290 --> 35:58.320
Moreover,

35:58.340 --> 36:00.800
he's the son of

36:01.420 --> 36:03.320
Yan Ruohai from the Investigator's Office.

36:06.050 --> 36:07.370
No way!

36:09.660 --> 36:12.000
We can't return the land we've taken!

36:12.180 --> 36:14.560
We can't return the land we've taken.

36:16.290 --> 36:18.010
Actually, what they really want

36:18.010 --> 36:21.410
are Xiao En and Si Lili.

36:22.380 --> 36:23.710
We can't let Xiao En go.

36:23.730 --> 36:24.880
If he goes back to Beiqi,

36:24.900 --> 36:26.120
he will retaliate like a mad dog!

36:26.140 --> 36:27.080
As a citizen of Nanqing,

36:27.100 --> 36:28.890
I can't accept that.

36:31.010 --> 36:32.410
We don't release him for nothing.

36:33.380 --> 36:35.000
It's an exchange.

36:36.290 --> 36:38.560
We can get Bingyun back.

36:39.770 --> 36:41.190
I'll go north tonight

36:41.210 --> 36:42.430
to sneak into the capital of Beiqi,

36:42.450 --> 36:43.950
so as to save my son.

36:43.970 --> 36:45.180
It's extremely difficult to go north

36:45.180 --> 36:46.340
and save him.

36:46.340 --> 36:48.040
As a father,

36:48.100 --> 36:49.840
I have to go.

36:50.010 --> 36:52.510
Exchange or not, it's not up to you.

36:52.530 --> 36:53.800
Head!

36:53.970 --> 36:55.400
Nor me!

36:55.420 --> 36:58.000
Only one man can make the call.

36:58.580 --> 36:59.470
Eunuch Hou.

36:59.490 --> 37:00.100
Yes.

37:00.100 --> 37:02.560
Ask the Investigator's Office
to release Xiao En and Si Lili right away.

37:02.730 --> 37:03.560
Your Majesty!

37:03.580 --> 37:04.800
Also,

37:04.900 --> 37:06.270
tell the Court of State Ceremonials that

37:06.290 --> 37:07.600
no land taken by my army

37:07.620 --> 37:08.750
shall be returned. Not an inch!

37:08.770 --> 37:11.600
The rest are open for discussion.

37:13.580 --> 37:15.080
Yan Bingyun

37:15.250 --> 37:16.840
must be back alive.

37:17.250 --> 37:18.650
Yes, Your Majesty.

37:23.140 --> 37:25.130
That's the decision of His Majesty.

37:25.210 --> 37:26.840
We can't let Xiao En go!

37:26.860 --> 37:28.080
Your Excellency Yan,

37:28.620 --> 37:30.760
His Majesty has a verbal instruction.

37:34.620 --> 37:36.270
His Majesty knows

37:36.290 --> 37:37.940
what kind of a person Xiao En is.

37:37.940 --> 37:40.250
If the Investigator's Office can catch him once,

37:40.250 --> 37:42.230
then you surely can catch him twice.

37:42.250 --> 37:44.690
By bearing disgrace and a heavy burden,

37:44.690 --> 37:46.730
Yan Bingyun lurked in the capital of Beiqi.

37:46.730 --> 37:48.730
He's worked his heart out.

37:49.620 --> 37:51.280
I've known it all.

37:51.380 --> 37:53.920
Exchanging a dying old man

37:53.940 --> 37:56.600
for a promising young man of our county,

37:56.620 --> 37:57.890
it's really worth it!

37:58.210 --> 38:00.560
Your Excellency Yan and the rest of you,

38:00.770 --> 38:02.210
His Majesty also said that

38:02.380 --> 38:05.490
Young Master Yan should come back alive.

38:08.660 --> 38:09.930
I

38:10.380 --> 38:12.760
accept the imperial edict
and thank His Majesty for showing mercy!

38:15.180 --> 38:18.370
We thank His Majesty for showing mercy!

38:57.100 --> 39:00.730
Fan Xian, give me the token for Director-General.

39:01.340 --> 39:02.730
Give it to me!

39:03.580 --> 39:04.970
Fan Xian,

39:05.490 --> 39:07.730
we'll meet again.

39:34.770 --> 39:35.600
Your Majesty,

39:35.620 --> 39:37.800
The Court of State Ceremonials and Beiqi mission

39:37.820 --> 39:39.430
have reached an agreement.

39:39.450 --> 39:41.190
Dongyi mission

39:41.210 --> 39:43.840
has offered all their gifts

39:43.860 --> 39:45.490
and is ready to leave.

39:51.140 --> 39:52.990
Despite the twists and turns,

39:53.010 --> 39:56.080
the Court of State Ceremonials has done a good job.

39:56.420 --> 39:57.600
Pass on my order.

39:57.900 --> 40:02.190
A banquet will be held
at the Hall of Prayer for Good Harvest tomorrow night

40:02.210 --> 40:03.800
for a joint celebration.

40:03.820 --> 40:05.170
Yes.

40:06.010 --> 40:07.410
Wait.

40:07.490 --> 40:10.600
Invite the Beiqi and Dongyi missions to the banquet.

40:10.620 --> 40:11.800
Hurry up!

40:11.820 --> 40:14.760
I see. I'll handle it.

40:22.490 --> 40:25.210
At the banquet tomorrow night, Nanqing officials,

40:25.730 --> 40:27.950
Beiqi courtiers, and Dongyi mission

40:27.970 --> 40:29.930
will have a joyous gathering.

40:30.100 --> 40:31.890
What an event!

40:33.420 --> 40:34.890
What about Zhuang Mohan?

40:35.580 --> 40:36.800
Who?

40:38.140 --> 40:39.970
Zhuang Mohan.

40:40.580 --> 40:43.130
He didn't seem to take part in the negotiation.

40:43.180 --> 40:44.600
Indeed!

40:45.100 --> 40:47.430
He disappeared once upon arrival in the capital city.

40:47.450 --> 40:48.840
After that, he's never left his room.

40:48.860 --> 40:49.840
He does nothing

40:49.860 --> 40:51.120
but reading books quietly.

40:51.140 --> 40:52.190
That's weird.

40:52.210 --> 40:54.380
A literary giant came all the way

40:54.380 --> 40:55.360
to the capital city

40:55.380 --> 40:57.400
without achieving anything,

40:57.420 --> 41:00.130
only to enjoy a banquet tomorrow night.

41:00.250 --> 41:02.210
If anything happens in that banquet,

41:02.210 --> 41:05.080
the world will know it in no time.

41:05.450 --> 41:07.510
Head, you mean

41:07.530 --> 41:08.940
Zhuang Mohan will make a move

41:08.940 --> 41:09.970
in the banquet.

41:09.970 --> 41:11.880
If he's up to something,
he must make a move tomorrow night.

41:11.900 --> 41:12.940
Then what should we do?

41:12.940 --> 41:14.270
Nothing.

41:14.290 --> 41:15.270
Just wait and see.

41:15.290 --> 41:17.230
Will we lose the initiative?

41:17.250 --> 41:18.930
There's no other way.

41:19.380 --> 41:21.750
Without knowing what he's been up to,

41:21.770 --> 41:23.600
we certainly can't take any precautions.

41:26.940 --> 41:28.210
One more thing.

41:28.770 --> 41:30.880
According to the information sent from Beiqi,

41:30.900 --> 41:32.640
my son was caught

41:32.660 --> 41:34.950
because his identity was disclosed.

41:34.970 --> 41:37.080
By secret agents from Beiqi?

41:37.490 --> 41:39.280
No, not from Beiqi.

41:40.690 --> 41:43.450
You mean from the capital city?

41:44.660 --> 41:46.990
He was betrayed by someone from the capital city.

41:47.010 --> 41:48.140
Bingyun lurking in Beiqi

41:48.140 --> 41:48.920
is a top secret.

41:48.940 --> 41:49.750
Besides His Majesty,

41:49.770 --> 41:50.290
only officials from

41:50.290 --> 41:51.600
our Investigator's Office know it.

41:51.620 --> 41:53.710
Can it be someone from our office?

41:53.730 --> 41:55.240
Why not?

41:56.450 --> 41:57.160
Head.

41:57.180 --> 41:57.820
I think we should carry out

41:57.820 --> 41:59.360
a thorough investigation right away.

41:59.380 --> 42:00.360
No need.

42:00.380 --> 42:02.510
It's a serious problem.

42:02.530 --> 42:04.210
It ends now.

42:04.210 --> 42:05.490
Never mention it again.

42:07.140 --> 42:08.370
Yes.

42:12.860 --> 42:15.080
The Investigator's Office has
been established for so many years.

42:15.100 --> 42:18.800
Time passes so quickly.

42:18.940 --> 42:21.970
It's time to replace some old stuff.

42:52.320 --> 42:55.900
In the river of history,

42:55.920 --> 42:59.390
time goes round and round.

43:02.200 --> 43:05.540
Memories about the former and present lives

43:05.560 --> 43:09.630
join each other in an endless way.

43:11.520 --> 43:14.140
In the long drunken Milky Way,

43:14.160 --> 43:16.400
one season follows another in a flash,

43:16.400 --> 43:18.900
and the wild geese are flying south.

43:18.920 --> 43:20.520
I just can't give up

43:20.520 --> 43:23.860
to be with you for my whole life.

43:23.880 --> 43:29.350
I have been hovering in the dreams
for hundreds and thousands of times.

43:30.600 --> 43:33.150
I can't even say a word when I watch the flowers falling.

43:33.440 --> 43:35.480
Year after year in the wandering,

43:35.480 --> 43:38.140
I count the remaining years.

43:38.160 --> 43:40.340
Even though we can't meet each other anymore,

43:40.360 --> 43:42.350
even though we have ended up the destiny,

43:42.640 --> 43:45.030
I never feel regretful.

43:45.080 --> 43:46.440
In such a chaotic world,

43:46.440 --> 43:49.420
I still miss you as ever.

43:49.440 --> 43:52.390
I can't fall asleep under the moon.

43:52.680 --> 43:54.740
With a gentle heart,

43:54.760 --> 43:57.420
I cherish our remaining years.

43:57.440 --> 43:58.960
Even though we have to go through

43:58.960 --> 44:01.470
all the hardships along the journey,

44:01.600 --> 44:08.790
you always stay by my side,

44:08.880 --> 44:11.550
watching the falling flowers, speechlessly.

44:11.840 --> 44:13.920
Year after year in the wandering,

44:13.920 --> 44:16.580
I count the remaining years.

44:16.600 --> 44:18.740
Even though we can't meet each other anymore,

44:18.760 --> 44:20.990
even though we end up the destiny,

44:21.200 --> 44:23.380
I never feel regretful.

44:23.400 --> 44:24.800
In such a chaotic world,

44:24.800 --> 44:27.860
I still miss you as ever.

44:27.880 --> 44:30.990
I can't fall asleep under the moon.

44:31.080 --> 44:33.220
With a gentle heart,

44:33.240 --> 44:35.940
I cherish our remaining years.

44:35.960 --> 44:37.400
Even though we have to go through

44:37.400 --> 44:40.060
all the hardships along the journey,

44:40.080 --> 44:48.840
you always stay by my side...
